t of the Cold War, you lead the Cabal, a secret organization trying to stop a conspiracy that aims to turn world leaders and nations against each other. Between missions you investigate classified files, interrogate captured agents and manage your operatives, while the field operations themselves play out as turn-based tactics.\n\nThe tone borrows from classic spy films, with paranoia and counterintelligence at the center. The campaign runs more than 40 hours, and there is PvP multiplayer as well. It suits fans of tactical strategy who enjoy a slow-burning espionage plot."}}